  "solution": [
    "Height: \\(10 \\cdot 6 \\cdot h = 360\\), so \\(h = 6\\).",
    "Surface area \\(= 2(lw + lh + wh) = 2(60 + 60 + 36) = 2(156) = 312\\)."
